      *> VIRALITY-SCORE.CUT
      *> Suite de cobol-unit-test para src/agents/VIRALITY-SCORE.cbl,
      *> llamado directamente. Mismo aviso que en test/CONTENT-PIPELINE.
      *> CUT: no se pudo correr contra el framework real en este entorno.
      *> Los textos de prueba fueron verificados por fuera con un script
      *> que replica INSPECT ... TALLYING ... FOR ALL, para confirmar el
      *> conteo exacto de palabras clave antes de escribir el EXPECT.

       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. VIRALITY-SCORE-TEST.

       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.

       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       COPY "VIRALITY-SCORE-IO.cpy".

       PROCEDURE DIVISION.

           TESTSUITE 'VIRALITY-SCORE - umbral por conteo de palabras clave'

           TESTCASE 'Cero coincidencias: LOW'
           MOVE SPACES TO VIRALITY-SCORE-REQUEST
           MOVE SPACES TO VIRALITY-SCORE-RESPONSE
           MOVE 'Cultura de equipos que mantienen sistemas antiguos' TO VS-GENERATED-TEXT
           CALL 'VIRALITY-SCORE' USING VIRALITY-SCORE-REQUEST VIRALITY-SCORE-RESPONSE
           EXPECT VS-STEP-STATUS TO BE 'Y'
           EXPECT VS-VIRALITY-LEVEL TO BE 'LOW'

           TESTCASE 'Una coincidencia (COBOL): MEDIUM'
           MOVE SPACES TO VIRALITY-SCORE-REQUEST
           MOVE SPACES TO VIRALITY-SCORE-RESPONSE
           MOVE 'Cultura de equipos que mantienen sistemas COBOL antiguos' TO VS-GENERATED-TEXT
           CALL 'VIRALITY-SCORE' USING VIRALITY-SCORE-REQUEST VIRALITY-SCORE-RESPONSE
           EXPECT VS-STEP-STATUS TO BE 'Y'
           EXPECT VS-VIRALITY-LEVEL TO BE 'MEDIUM'

           TESTCASE 'Cuatro coincidencias (IA, COBOL, LEGACY, MODERNIZ): HIGH'
           MOVE SPACES TO VIRALITY-SCORE-REQUEST
           MOVE SPACES TO VIRALITY-SCORE-RESPONSE
           MOVE 'Modernizacion de COBOL con IA aplicada a sistemas legacy' TO VS-GENERATED-TEXT
           CALL 'VIRALITY-SCORE' USING VIRALITY-SCORE-REQUEST VIRALITY-SCORE-RESPONSE
           EXPECT VS-STEP-STATUS TO BE 'Y'
           EXPECT VS-VIRALITY-LEVEL TO BE 'HIGH'

           GOBACK.
